! Iliev et al. (2006) Test 2: hydrogen ionized by a 1e5 K blackbody, on the spot,
! with heating and cooling. The rates are those of Quokka's
! photoionization_H_caseB_handwritten network.
H  -> H+ + E                   []         PHOTO, 13.60
H+ + E -> H                    []         2.63e-13*(Tgas/1e4)**(-0.7)
H + E -> H+ + E + E            []         chemRate2(tgas)
